# Optional. Leave unset for the built-in offline map (beige background, no network, no external tiles).
#
# To draw the plan on the map server's basemap (the same one the phone uses), set the address of its style.json.
# It may be RELATIVE (same address as the dashboard, e.g. behind Nginx on port 8000):
# VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL=/map/style.json
# or absolute:
# VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL=http://192.168.1.50:8000/map/style.json
#
# This value is baked in when the dashboard is built (npm run build) or started (npm run dev); change it, then rebuild.
# If the map server cannot be reached the dashboard falls back to the offline map and shows
# "Basemap unavailable: showing the plan only". See docs/BASEMAP.md.
#
# Development only: where `npm run dev` forwards /map requests (default http://localhost:8000, the Nginx front door).
# DEV_MAP_PROXY=http://localhost:8000
